  "title": "Tools for Pixel Art",
  "date": "2026-10-28T22:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Tools for Pixel Art\n\nKenny Shape\n\nKenny Shape\n\nKenny just released its Voxel Art maker -- Kenny Shape. This time, I can use aseprite to make pixel art then use it to make it lowpoly 3D.\n\nYears ago, I tried MagicaVoxel.  I found it super relieving to use it. But you need a little 3D mind to build it.\n\nLast year, while I was studying the 3D scan class at school. I also tried to use hunyuan model to make a lowpoly grandpa.\n\ngrandpa\n\nThese are great tools for making an XR app.\n\nUniversal LPC Spritesheet Character Generator\n\nsprite sheet\n\nTwo years ago, when I was doing the 2D graphic class. I always wanted to make a character movement sprite sheet tool.\n\nUniversal LPC Spritesheet Character Generator is one implementation. You have to mention the author in your product. Anyway, the implementation is so completed, strong suggest to try.",
